stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Perceive
  Perceive --> Clarify: missing input
  Clarify --> Perceive
  Perceive --> Retrieve
  Retrieve --> Plan
  Plan --> Execute
  Execute --> Evaluate
  Evaluate --> Respond: pass
  Evaluate --> Retrieve: evidence gap
  Evaluate --> Plan: plan error
  Evaluate --> Execute: retry/fallback
  Evaluate --> HITL: high risk/conflict
  HITL --> Execute: approved
  HITL --> Terminate: denied
  Evaluate --> Terminate: stagnation/budget
  Respond --> [*]
  Terminate --> [*]

